// Nothing holds a borer up but the rock round it. Set down on a ledge in a big cave heading west and driven off its
// end, out over a pit with nothing within reach of its head or its cab, it falls (the mole still in its cab) and lands
// on the pit floor, where it rests: falling, it cuts nothing.
map
